{"ref":"BDB, מְרֹרָה","hw":"מְרֹרָה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מְרֹרָה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. bitter thing, gall, poison</strong>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְרוֹרַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:14\" href=\"/Job.20.14\">Jb 20:14</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְרֹרָתוֹ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Job 20:25\" href=\"/Job.20.25\">25</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְרֹרֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:32\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.32\">Dt 32:32</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְרֹרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 13:26\" href=\"/Job.13.26\">Jb 13:26</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>gall</em>, i.e. seat of gall, gall-bladder <a data-ref=\"Job 20:25\" href=\"/Job.20.25\">Jb 20:25</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּוָה</span> <em>back;</em> cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מְרֵרָה\" href=\"/BDB,_מְרֵרָה\", dir=\"rtl\">מְרֵרָה</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 16:13\" href=\"/Job.16.13\">16:13</a>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  = <em>poison</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ פְּתָנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:14\" href=\"/Job.20.14\">Jb 20:14</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">מְרֹרוֹת</span> <em>bitter things</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 13:26\" href=\"/Job.13.26\">Jb 13:26</a> (of God’s edict of judgment).<br><strong>4.</strong>  pl. abstr. = <em>bitterness;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אַשְׁכְּלֹת מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:32\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.32\">Dt 32:32</a> <em>clusters of bitterness</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עִנְּבֵי רוֹשׁ</span>).","next":"BDB, מְרֵרָה","prev":"BDB, מָרֹר"}